OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThe rising Belgian trombonist and
OL,12,     Gbandleader is giving out four
OL,13,     Gbouquets this week.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GYunchan Lim makes his Proms debut
OL,16,     Gwith the BBC Symphony Orchestra,
OL,17,     Gperforming Beethoven's 'Emperor'
OL,18,     Gconcerto. Bookending the Prom are
OL,19,     GBruckner's First Symphony and
OL,20,     GTuur's Aditus.
